      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: The patch notes says \"from Quick Menu\" but in fact it is also removed from the Main Menu. Users are no longer able to change microphone devices on Quest.\n\nI just want the microphone device setting to be \"Android camcorder input\", so I don't care where I can set it from.",
