      "value": "@{5f4633fc16f559333395cc93|full_name}: I'm not sure how much of a hassle it would be, but I think a screenshot of the big menu on the audio tab would be useful.\n\n\"This is where I'd change my input device if I could\" vibe.\n\nBut yeah, add a picture, and also edit in a mention that calls out that it's not in the big menu.\n\nFor the pro is there multiple microphones on the headset? \"Android camcorder input\" sounds weird to me",
