      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: On Quest Pro, Unity's Microphone.devices recognizes three microphone devices: \"Android audio input\", \"Android camcordar input\" and \"Android voice recognition input\".\n\nI think these correspond to \"MIC\", \"CAMCORDER\" and \"VOICE_RECOGNITION\" of Android's MediaRecorder.AudioSource. These not only distinguish physical microphone devices, but also distinguish preprocessing such as whether noise reduction is enabled or disabled.\n\nEven if the Quest Pro has only one physical microphone device, the audio data obtained may differ depending on these specifications.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
